{"version":1,"content":"<p>惹味富香料氣息的東南亞菜，無論是街頭小食又或精選菜單，都各有風味。</p><p>近日除有越南菜新店開幕，還有餐廳推出越式和泰式新菜單和驚喜禮遇，又是時候約朋友大擦一番。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;越式悠閒&lt;br/&gt;剛於啟德開設</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:15:52.278382+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T06:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T06:09:39.386903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:09:39.386903+00:00","content_hash":"ad679a05e39f121d4deb5cf7801752cfd06bfc80a5ca749bd124c8400ab3e59e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}